    {
      "timestamp": "10:47:17",
      "index": 18,
      "pageno": 53,
      "identity": "1319",
      "text": "They were a payment to the"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "10:47:21",
      "index": 19,
      "pageno": 53,
      "identity": "1320",
      "text": "bank for a service, which was setting up the guarantee,"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "10:47:26",
      "index": 20,
      "pageno": 53,
      "identity": "1321",
      "text": "so there was no flow to the sanctioned"
    }
  ],
  "6ea46f65-9e55-4f8b-84e8-5009d18ac381": [
    {
      "timestamp": "09:09:27",
      "index": 17,
      "pageno": 6,
      "identity": "143",
      "text": "Did Mr -- how do you pronounce his name properly,"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "09:09:30",
      "index": 18,
      "pageno": 6,
      "identity": "144",
      "text": "\"Go-et\" or?"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "09:09:31",
      "index": 19,
      "pageno": 6,
      "identity": "145",
      "text": "MR TALANOV: I guess \"Goeth\", but I may be wrong, I am not"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "09:09:33",
      "index": 20,
      "pageno": 6,
      "identity": "146",
      "text": "a native speaker."
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "09:09:35",
      "index": 21,
      "pageno": 6,
      "identity": "147",
      "text": "DR REINER: Did he sign any declaration of confidentiality"
    }
  ],
  "0f9cb720-feac-49a1-bf39-69de026f42e0": [
    {
      "timestamp": "10:38:05",
      "index": 19,
      "pageno": 48,
      "identity": "1195",
      "text": "The third and final form of prohibition relied on"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "10:38:10",
      "index": 20,
      "pageno": 48,
      "identity": "1196",
      "text": "relates to circumvention provisions, and they are"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "10:38:14",
      "index": 21,
      "pageno": 48,
      "identity": "1197",
      "text": "applicable alongside the prohibitions we have already"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "10:38:18",
      "index": 22,
      "pageno": 48,
      "identity": "1198",
      "text": "looked at, and circumvention of a sanction is broader"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "10:38:24",
      "index": 23,
      "pageno": 48,
      "identity": "1199",
      "text": "than a violation of it."
    }
  ],
  "00b08bb4-c7c1-4553-9590-0bdd725f53e7": [
    {
      "timestamp": "10:47:01",
      "index": 14,
      "pageno": 53,
      "identity": "1315",
      "text": "But the end beneficiary of the"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "10:47:05",
      "index": 15,
      "pageno": 53,
      "identity": "1316",
      "text": "guarantee was sanctioned. It"
    }
  ],
