      "text": "MR TALANOV: I need to check, not to mislead you, but it"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "09:06:58",
      "index": 7,
      "pageno": 5,
      "identity": "108",
      "text": "was something around 27 or 28 February."
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "09:07:02",
      "index": 8,
      "pageno": 5,
      "identity": "109",
      "text": "PRESIDENT: Thank you."
    }
  ],
  "b06f5841-ca3d-462f-bdd2-1f619e55d9c6": [
    {
      "timestamp": "09:01:38",
      "index": 0,
      "pageno": 2,
      "identity": "26",
      "text": "the tribunal. First of all, we are very glad to see"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "09:01:41",
      "index": 1,
      "pageno": 2,
      "identity": "27",
      "text": "that also the tribunal could be -- everyone on the"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "09:01:46",
      "index": 2,
      "pageno": 2,
      "identity": "28",
      "text": "tribunal could be here personally. We are very glad"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "09:01:51",
      "index": 3,
      "pageno": 2,
      "identity": "29",
      "text": "about that."
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "09:01:54",
      "index": 4,
      "pageno": 2,
      "identity": "30",
      "text": "Thank you, there are no other matters at this moment"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "09:01:56",
      "index": 5,
      "pageno": 2,
      "identity": "31",
      "text": "to decide."
    }
  ],
  "946d3e1b-20f6-46e1-b606-da3393c7a195": [
    {
      "timestamp": "09:00:38",
      "index": 7,
      "pageno": 1,
      "identity": "8",
      "text": "We have, before we start the evidentiary hearing"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "09:00:40",
      "index": 8,
      "pageno": 1,
      "identity": "9",
      "text": "with the opening statements of the respective parties,"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "09:00:44",
      "index": 9,
      "pageno": 1,
      "identity": "10",
      "text": "I have to review and decide on a few procedural matters."
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "09:00:48",
      "index": 10,
      "pageno": 1,
      "identity": "11",
      "text": "The first matter on the agenda today is the"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "09:00:51",
      "index": 11,
      "pageno": 1,
      "identity": "12",
      "text": "participation of Mr Goeth to this hearing and to this"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "09:00:55",
      "index": 12,
      "pageno": 1,
      "identity": "13",
      "text": "arbitration."
    }
  ],
  "a270fe6f-841f-4e14-a118-ce750b5aaee4": [
    {
      "timestamp": "09:00:26",
      "index": 4,
      "pageno": 1,
      "identity": "5",
      "text": "The members of the tribunal are very happy to meet"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "09:00:30",
      "index": 5,
      "pageno": 1,
      "identity": "6",
      "text": "with the parties and counsel representatives, we look"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "09:00:34",
      "index": 6,
      "pageno": 1,
      "identity": "7",
      "text": "forward for this two-week hearing."
    }
  ],
  "4dc0949d-5167-40ae-87c4-8f2a2f65054b": [
    {
      "timestamp": "09:56:17",
      "index": 2,
      "pageno": 27,
      "identity": "653",
      "text": "The legal consequences of the facts of the case are,"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "09:56:22",
      "index": 3,
      "pageno": 27,
      "identity": "654",
      "text": "first, PPD was not obliged to comply with decree 172 or"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "09:56:29",
      "index": 4,
      "pageno": 27,
      "identity": "655",
      "text": "decree 254 due to the application of sanctions, due to"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "09:56:34",
      "index": 5,
      "pageno": 27,
      "identity": "656",
      "text": "article 102 TFEU, PPD did not consent to the variation"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "09:56:42",
      "index": 6,
      "pageno": 27,
      "identity": "657",
      "text": "of the contract and did not accept to offer -- the offer"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "09:56:47",
      "index": 7,
      "pageno": 27,
      "identity": "658",
      "text": "to vary the contract."
    }
  ],
  "7ed2c052-8745-41ab-80d1-c7a9bfcdf401": [
    {
      "timestamp": "09:04:52",
      "index": 3,
      "pageno": 4,
      "identity": "79",
      "text": "May I first ask counsel for respondent whether"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "09:04:55",
      "index": 4,
      "pageno": 4,
      "identity": "80",
      "text": "Mr Goeth is in attendance right now, in this room?"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "09:04:59",
      "index": 5,
      "pageno": 4,
      "identity": "81",
      "text": "MR TALANOV: Mr Goeth is not in attendance in this room"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "09:05:01",
      "index": 6,
      "pageno": 4,
      "identity": "82",
      "text": "now."
    }
  ],
  "3bcd0fee-873e-45ef-9b6d-907ec97d1feb": [
    {
      "timestamp": "09:07:19",
      "index": 10,
      "pageno": 5,
      "identity": "111",
      "text": "that date that you had appointed new counsel? Because"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "09:07:23",
      "index": 11,
      "pageno": 5,
      "identity": "112",
      "text": "the list of participants is not really related to any"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "09:07:26",
      "index": 12,
      "pageno": 5,
      "identity": "113",
      "text": "change or any amendment to the representative"
    }
  ]
